{
  "schema": "pangea.parity.progression.star_count/1",
  "description": "Byte-identical cross-language parity vectors for the per-session own-star count (Phase B spec B.1.2 step 1), the per-activity MAX (step 2), and the earnable-stars ceiling. Inputs are the REAL Matrix/CMS content shapes: `roles` is the `roles` map of `pangea.activity_roles`, `awarded_goals` is the raw `pangea.orchestrator_awarded_goals` content, and `plan_roles` is the activity's CMS-authored role map (the `pangea.activity_plan` state event is a THIN reference and carries no goals). Source of truth: client-dosage-a2 orchestrator_awarded_goals.dart, orchestrator_room_extension.dart (ownCompletedGoals), quests_client_extension.dart (userStarsByActivity), activity_plan_model.dart (allGoals / earnableStars). Vendored byte-identical into client-dosage-a2/test/fixtures/parity/progression/ and verified on each side against that side's own MANIFEST.sha256.",
  "notes": [
    "A star IS one orchestrator-awarded goal of the player's OWN role: own_stars = len(ownCompletedGoals), counted by iterating the role's allGoals and testing each for an award (slug first, goal id as fallback). Iterating the canonical goal list is what makes a duplicated award entry count once and what keeps a flat legacy award from crediting a goal the role does not declare.",
    "The player's role is resolved the way the client resolves it: the `roles` entry whose user_id is the player, then that role_id in `plan_roles`.",
    "stars_by_activity takes the MAX across sessions of the same activity (never the sum, never the last).",
    "earnable_by_activity is min(len(allGoals)) across the activity's plan roles, and 0 when the plan carries no roles."
  ],
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "duplicate-awards-counted-once",
      "pins": ["the same slug awarded twice counts ONCE"],
      "input": {
        "player": "@student:pangea.chat",
        "sessions": [
          {
            "activity_id": "a1",
            "roles": {
              "r1": {
                "id": "r1",
                "user_id": "@student:pangea.chat",
                "role": "shopper",
                "finished_at": "2026-07-18T10:05:00Z",
                "archived_at": "2026-07-18T10:06:00Z"
              }
            },
            "plan_roles": {
              "r1": {
                "id": "r1",
                "name": "Shopper",
                "goal": null,
                "goals": [
                  {"id": "g1", "goal_slug": "buy-bread", "description": "Buy bread"}
                ]
              }
            },
            "awarded_goals": {
              "awards": {"r1": ["buy-bread", "buy-bread"]},
              "legacy_flat_goal_ids": []
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "own_stars_per_session": [1],
        "stars_by_activity": {"a1": 1},
        "earnable_by_activity": {"a1": 1}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "replayed-and-out-of-order-sessions-take-the-max",
